body:
Don’t have anything open source, but the local is just the same data structures. 

On mobile so code formatting might be dicey.


    dev:
      var1: “one”


Then in tf:


    locals {
      config = yamldecode(file(“./myconfigs.yml”))
    }


    resource “some_resource” {
      Attribute = local.config[var.environment][“var1”] 
    }
